WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.780
Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier and welcome to Hitogotchi

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:06.600
I don't know if I'm pronouncing that right, but I didn't pronounce Tamagotchi either

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.180
which is good segway into what I was gonna talk about.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.120
High five, me! (High five) Great job, me!

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.320
I'm the king of talking to myself alone, oh God...

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.720
Anyway, so if you guys remember Tamagotchis

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.200
They were these little things that you had on a key-chain...

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.280
Insert graphic of Tamagotchi

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:27.420
And you would take care of this Tamagotchi that I'm gonna make really hard to animate

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:28.260
...later...

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.320
Where is it?

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.200
(regretful laugh)

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.700
If you remember a Tamagotchi, they were like a hit, for like a few years

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.760
and some people still have them to this day

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.620
I know there's some people in the comments right now

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:41.900
that are still taking care of their Tamagotchi.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.900
But what they were - they were pets

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.900
that you... kept around

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.660
And it was like, it was like, it was like

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:49.660
you bought a key-chain of responsibility

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:53.200
You bought something that you had to keep alive

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.620
And it was very hard to keep ali-

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:58.000
It was very easy to let it die

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.000
and then you'd be sad

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.000
so it was a little ball of sadness

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.000
and a little bit of happiness

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.000
that you carried around with you.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.640
It's a ticking time bomb of disappointment

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:08.040
is basically what that is.

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:09.380
But it was fun!

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:09.880
maybe...

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.320
But this is "Hitogotchi"

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:14.480
which is supposed to be the inverse of Tamagotchi

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:16.200
where you...

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:17.640
or I...

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.240
...am the Tamagotchi.

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:20.940
I don't know. Helloooo!

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:22.000
(Reading onscreen text) [Girl] "Um... hello!"

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:27.740
"I'm the person assigned to take care of... a monster?"

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:28.980
Ahn... is that me?

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:30.480
Is that who I am?

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:31.480
[Girl] "Is this the right house?"

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.820
(Deep, raspy voice) Leave! Leave AND NEVER RETURN

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:36.660
YOU COME AND FOUND THE MONSTER!

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.360
NOW NEVER GO BACK!

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:41.760
TELL EVERYONE, THAT HE IS A SCREAMING IDIOT!

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:43.300
WITH A STUPID RED HAIR!

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:44.680
[Gril] "Hey! That's kind of rude."

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:47.480
Well, I am a monster so there you have it.

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:49.360
[Girl] "Wait a minute, you're..."

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:54.520
[Narration] "The girl stares your face for an awkward amount of time"

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:57.260
I know! I'm blazingly handsome

00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:59.860
It's a burden that I have to bear.

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:00.880
[Girl] "Yeah! You're the one!"

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:04.200
"Oh, um, let me introduce myself."

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:09.840
"My name is Nadine, and I will be your personal caretaker for the week."

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:14.820
"This will be my first time taking care of a non-human, so I hope we can get along!"

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:20.500
[Mark] You shoul-... (Raspy voice) YOU SHOULDN'T HAVE COME HERE! YOU SHOULD- I THOUGHT I WARNED YOU!

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:24.000
I thought this-- I thought the posters of my face outside the walls

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.740
were enough to ward anybody away.

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:27.500
YOU SHOULDN'T HAVE COME HERE!

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:31.000
[Nadine] "Now, now, no need to be rude to someone you just met."

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:35.000
"Well then, I'll be sorting my things upstairs for a little while, I'll see you in a bit."

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:36.700
O-Okay.

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:39.640
[Narration] "Nadine brings her luggage as she goes up the stairs."

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:42.240
[Nadine] "So! What we do our first day together?"

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.320
[Mark] Eat, play, sleep, talk?

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:48.260
Um... only so long as to get to eat you!

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:50.200
Uh... I guess we could talk...?

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.500
[Nadine] "So... where's your family?"

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.940
[Mark] I-I-I... ate... I ate them.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.940
I... I kinda ate them.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.360
I might of a little bit ate them.

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.900
[Nadine] "Ate them?" (deep, guttural laugh)

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:03.380
"That's funny."

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.380
[Narration] "You spent time talking with Nadine"

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:07.380
[Nadine] "Time for you to sleep! I cant wait for tomorrow."

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:09.700
[Narration] "You had a well deserved rest."

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:10.760
[Mark] Oh! Shit!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.860
[Ominous voice] "You're doing better than last time."

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:14.100
[Mark] What is that supposed to mean?!

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:15.820
[Nadine] "Morning! What should we do today?"

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:17.160
[Mark] Eaaaat?

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:19.820
[Narration] "The menu for today is... nothing."

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:23.260
[Nadine] "I'm sorry, the agency didn't give me any food for today..."

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.880
[Mark] I'LL "EAT" YOU INSTEAD!

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.860
[Nadine] "Eh...? Wh- What are you saying?"

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:31.340
[Mark] Why are you happy about that?

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:33.180
NO, DON'T GET THE WRONG IDEAS HERE!

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:34.380
[Narration] "What do you have on your mind?"

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:35.760
[Mark] Uhhh...

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:37.700
Play?

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.800
[Narration] "Nadine brought a maracas."

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.140
[Nadine] "Shake shake shake!"

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:46.600
[Mark] You su- You suc- Oh, God I'm such an asshole!

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:47.940
But I am a monster!

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:49.700
"You suck at your job!"

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:51.280
[Nadine] "I'm doing what I can!"

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.180
[Narration] "You shook the maracas."

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.640
[Nadine] "Hey, um... how am I doing as your caretaker?"

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:58.000
[Mark] Oh, geez! Oh, man!

00:03:58.060 --> 00:03:59.660
Well you didn't feed me,

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:03.240
so if I had to a- give any answer, it'd probably be...

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:05.100
...meh...

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:08.080
I mean, you brought maracas, and I do like maracas, so...

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:08.900
So-so.

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:10.560
[Nadine] "Really? Thanks."

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.380
"I'll do my best for the rest of the week."

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:15.640
[Ominous voice] "Blood... doesn't that girl have it...?"

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.180
"I wonder how it tastes..."

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:20.600
[Mark] Oh, geez! Oh, geez!

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:21.720
OH, GEEZ!

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.780
Is - Is - Are these options gonna do

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.300
what I think they're gonna do?

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:26.920
(exhales reluctantly)

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:29.180
"Kill?"

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:30.600
"Kill her?"

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:32.240
[Nadine] "Oh, do you need something?"

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.740
[Ominous voice] "Just like the other ones?"

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:36.660
"BE DONE WITH IT."

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:38.060
[Nadine] "What is it?"

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.380
[Mark] I don't know what I expected...

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.980
[Ominous voice] "MONSTERS CAN'T CHANGE."

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:55.020
"YOU NEVER LEARN."

00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:58.380
[Mark] Oh, shit! Well I - I guess that's it, then!

00:04:58.700 --> 00:04:59.320
WELL

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:00.440
FUCKERNUT

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.380
I DONE-DID A GOOF.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:04.060
I GOOFED REAL HARD,

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.460
I DID BAD,

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:07.580
You guys are all disappointed in me,

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:08.700
but don't worry!

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.500
I'm gonna blast through this with expert-

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:12.940
something-or-other.

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:13.780
[Nadine] "Hello!"

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:14.560
[Mark] Hello!

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:17.400
It is the right house! Indeed, welcome!

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:18.500
Come on in!

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:21.080
[Nadine] "Ah, good! I thought I went to the wrong place for a second, there."

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.300
"Wait a minute, you're..."

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:24.040
[Narration] "The girl stares at your face..."

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:24.900
[Nadine] "You're the one..."

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:27.020
"My first time taking care of a non-human..."

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:27.840
[Mark] ...Sure we will!

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:29.640
We're gonna get along great!

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:30.980
[Nadine] "Glad you think that too."

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:33.040
"I'll be sorting my things upstairs for a little while."

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:33.740
[Mark] See you in a bit!

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:34.920
[Nadine] "...So! What should we do?"

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.100
[Mark] Oh! We should play!

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:38.780
...brought a ball!?

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:39.920
[Narration] "She threw it."

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:41.040
[Nadine] "Fetch!"

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.960
[Mark] Well, I'm not a dog!

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:45.520
[Nadine] "Ahaha, sorry."

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.840
"I'm not sure about what things a non-human would want."

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:51.000
[Narration] "You played along with her for a bit."

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.760
[Nadine] "Time for you to sleep! I can't wait for tomorrow!"

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:53.840
[Ominous voice] "Blood..."

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:54.540
[Mark] Blah-blah.

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:55.380
No,

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:57.240
why is this an option now?!

00:05:57.720 --> 00:05:58.460
No!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:05:59.780
[Ominous voice] "Is that so?"

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:01.240
"Hmhmhm..."

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:02.160
[Nadine] "Morning!"

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:03.020
[Mark] Alright, let's...

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:03.840
...talk.

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:05.760
[Nadine] "Have you ever tried taking care of a pet?"

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:08.080
[Mark] They get scared of me.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:09.380
[Nadine] "Oh..."

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:10.960
"...I don't think you're scary."

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:12.780
[Narration] "You talked to Nadine for a while."

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:14.920
"What do you have on your mind?"

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:16.440
[Mark] Maybe we could eat?

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:18.420
OOOH this is where it...

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:18.920
Oh.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:19.640
This is - Oh!

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:20.580
Okay.

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.880
I'll "eat" you instead!

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.980
Which FOR SOME REASON causes you to blush...

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:27.760
Your eyes go star...

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.120
and a heart appear up in the top.

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:33.860
I'm assuming what each of those slots probably means another day in the week.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:35.020
You're doing...

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:36.620
Eh, you're doing alright.

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:37.760
You're doing OK.

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:38.800
[Ominous voice] "Stop trying to be human."

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:41.480
"She smells... quite nice."

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:43.780
[Mark] Why is that monster shaped like a heart?

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:45.840
[Ominous voice] "Maybe even better than the last."

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.400
"Just a little flesh would be nice, wouldn't it?"

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:49.620
[Mark] WHADDYA TRYNA SAY THERE, BUDDY?

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:50.780
WHADDYA TRYNA SAY?

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:51.880
OHOHO!

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:52.520
No.

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:54.240
[Ominous voice] "Really, now?"

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:55.780
"Accept it..."

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:57.520
[Mark] I dunno what I'm supposed to be accepting!

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:00.120
I - I - I need food, so that'd be nice!

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:01.380
[Nadine] "Time to wake up and get moving!"

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:02.360
[Mark] FEED ME!

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:04.440
[Narration] "The menu for today is... pie."

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:07.720
[Nadine] "Home-made pie, to be exact! I made it myself, I hope you like it!"

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:10.100
[Mark] It tastes good.

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:11.600
Okay, I finished eating,

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:12.760
so that's a little bit better!

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.500
So maybe I'm not going to murder you!

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:15.940
[Nadine] "What should we do this afternoon?"

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:18.820
[Mark] Well we should probably play...

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:19.980
[Nadine] "So, um..."

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:21.960
"What do you usually play? I don't really know."

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:23.580
[Mark] VIDEO GAMES!

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:24.820
HELL YES!

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:26.580
[Nadine] "I see... Hm..."

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:28.640
[Narration] "Nadine pondered for a long while."

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:31.000
[Mark] Why - YOU PONDERED?

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:33.200
YOU DIDN'T GIVE ME A GOD-DAMN GAME?!

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:34.160
WHAT THE HECK?!

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:35.100
WHAT THE HECKY-HECK?!

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:37.260
[Nadine] "It's getting quite late, time to sleep!"

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:38.460
[Ominous voice] "Blood..."

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:39.580
"Doesn't that girl have it?"

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:41.140
[Mark] Goddammit-

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:41.640
NO!

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:43.840
[Nadine] "It's been a few days since I started taking care of you."

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:45.820
"...You weren't that bad of a monster."

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:47.220
[Mark] Are you falling for me?

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:49.660
[Nadine] "Ahaha, you dummy..."

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:50.340
(Mark laughs)

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:53.280
[Nadine] "Okay!" (chuckles) "Let's start the day with a bang!"

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:54.060
[Mark] Alright.

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:54.800
Let's...

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:56.480
PLAY!

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:57.680
[Narration] "Nadine brought--"

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:00.240
[Mark] OH! You brought vidya games!

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:03.660
[Nadine] "Hey, look! I'm sure you'll like it! It's a game where you roll this ball and..."

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:05.900
[Mark] I've played that before.

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:08.640
[Nadine] "Oh! In that case, will you give me some tips and tricks about it?"

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.720
[Narration] "You played along with Nadine for a bit."

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:12.100
[Mark] O-Ooh!

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:13.480
That's sweet~!

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:15.620
[Nadine] "Hmm... something to do, something to do..."

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:16.920
[Mark] Well, we could eat!

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:18.820
[Narration] "The menu today is soup."

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:21.640
[Nadine] "This... wouldn't really make you full, huh?"

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.220
[Mark] It's - IT'S SOMETHING!

00:08:23.220 --> 00:08:24.160
I like soup!

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.300
Hey, I'm a soup kind of guy!

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.180
[Nadine] "Mhm, we should be content with what we are given!"

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:29.820
[Narration] "You finished eating and cleaned up."

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:32.100
[Nadine] "I'll be submitting some reports to the agency tonight."

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:33.460
"Have a good sleep!"

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:34.600
"I didn't get much sleep today..."

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.280
[Mark] Oh, do you just wanna sleep?

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:37.960
You want - You want to take a nap?

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:39.260
Wanna take a nap?

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:40.580
Take a nap!

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:41.760
(Repeating) Take a nap!

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:42.940
(Repeating again) Take a nap!

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:44.260
[Nadine] "I'll sing you a song while you nap."

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:45.620
[Mark] Oh!

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:48.220
[Narration] "You listened to Nadine as you slowly drifted to sleep."

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:50.600
[Nadine] "Any plans to do something?"

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:52.280
[Mark] Well, we should probably eat.

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:55.100
[Narration] "The menu for today is slime salad."

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:56.440
[Mark] Yay?

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.760
[Nadine] "...This... certainly looks quite appetizing..."

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:00.160
[Mark] I KNOW...

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.240
You should try it!

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:02.160
Try it!

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:03.380
C'mon, try it!

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:05.300
[Nadine] "Is this a thing really edible...?"

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:07.060
[Narration] "Nadine takes a bite."

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.300
[Ominous voice] "You didn't tell her that it's poi--"

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:11.440
[Mark] OH COME ON!

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:12.500
WHAT?!

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:14.240
WHAT THE FUCK?!

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:15.580
NO!

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:16.740
WHAT?!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:18.620
WHAT -- ARE YOU KIDDING ME?!

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:20.720
BULLSHIT ON THAT!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.300
WHAT A LOAD OF ASS-DICKS!

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:24.160
Alright so what I'm gonna do,

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:27.140
there's gotta be a way to get hearts on every single one of them,

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:29.160
which is what I imagine's gonna be good.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:30.540
At least I guess, maybe...

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.120
[Nadine] "Do you go to school?"

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:32.820
[Mark] OH,

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:33.500
PFFT!

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:34.980
TOO COOL FOR THAT!

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:36.520
Way too cool!

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:37.020
Heh!

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:38.480
[Nadine] "You do seem smart, after all."

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:39.440
[Mark] Hey...

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:40.620
Yeah, (chuckling)

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:41.580
Yeah!

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.400
Hell yeah I do!

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:45.140
[Nadine] "What should we do this afternoon?"

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:46.540
[Mark] Well I dunno.

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:48.140
You have something on Day 3, right?

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:49.160
Pie.

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:51.940
Ooh. It tastes good.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.180
It tastes reeeal good...

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.300
[Narration] "Getting quite late, time to sleep!"

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:56.600
[Ominous voice] "You're doing better...!"

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:59.340
[Mark] Hey, I haven't even had a night urge to eat her!

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:00.980
I think I'm doing great!

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.120
Are you falling for me?

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:03.160
He-He-ey!

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:04.700
Ho-ho-ho-ho!

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:05.740
Yeah!

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:08.460
Alright, let's start this off with a BANG!

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:09.780
With...

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:11.600
Uh...

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.020
(Contemplative noise)

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:14.760
Talking?

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:16.960
[Nadine] "Hey, do you have any friends?"

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:18.280
[Mark] I'M A MONSTER!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.660
I HAVE NO FRIENDS!

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:21.680
NOBODY WANTED ME,

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:23.960
NOBODY LIKED ME,

00:10:24.280 --> 00:10:26.620
AND NOBODY WANTED TO BE NEAR ME!

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:27.980
Nobody wanted me...

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:31.500
[Nadine] "Really...? You seem like you would be a really good friend to have!"

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:34.340
[Narration] "You had a fun conversation with Nadine."

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:35.740
[Mark] Aw, that's lovely~!

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:37.780
[Nadine] "Hmm... something to do,"

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:39.220
[Mark] I'm guessing...

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:40.340
I...

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:41.340
need...

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:42.680
to...

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:44.780
...take... a nap!

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:46.520
Because that's what I need!

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:48.400
You have a needs thing in the top left,

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:49.680
So I'm assuming...

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.900
I'm gonna nip-nap the day away!

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:53.620
[Nadine] "I'll read you something as you sleep."

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:58.500
"Day One, Evening. A lady wearing white was sighted near my house. It was said that she..."

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:01.340
[Narration] "You pretended not to hear the story and fell asleep."

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:02.360
[Mark] Nice.

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:05.000
[Nadine] "I'll be submitting some reports to the agency tonight."

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:06.100
"Have a good sleep!"

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:07.300
[Narration] "You had a nice long sleep."

00:11:07.880 --> 00:11:09.460
"You woke up feeling really great!"

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:10.700
[Nadine] "I didn't get much sleep today..."

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:11.940
[Mark] You wanna-

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:13.500
Do you wanna talk it out?

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:14.540
You wanna talk?

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:15.580
You wanna talk about it?

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:16.860
[Nadine] "So what are your hobbies?"

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:18.720
[Mark] NOT WANTING A CARETAK---

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:19.240
Cooking!

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:20.380
[Nadine] Wow,"

00:11:20.520 --> 00:11:23.960
"I never thought you'd be into that! I'm a decent cook myself. Would you teach me?"

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:27.300
[Narration] "You conversed with Nadine as the hours go by."

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:28.760
[Nadine] "Any plans?"

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:30.500
[Mark] Let's eat!

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:31.660
No, let's...

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:32.520
PLAAY~

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:34.060
No, let's eat!

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:35.540
And this time, NOT...

00:11:35.640 --> 00:11:36.900
You're not gonna get--

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:38.340
You're not gonna die.

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:39.420
I know.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.140
[Nadine] "Let's have something else after this, shall we?"

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.160
[Mark] Aw, shit!

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:45.580
GODDAMMIT I was gonna end it on a good note!

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:48.320
[Nadine] "What a good day that was! Well, see you tomorrow!"

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.080
[Mark] (muttering) Well, it was going to be a good day...

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:52.140
[Nadine] "Wake up sunshine, all is well today!"

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:52.840
[Mark] Rea- Is it?

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:54.300
Is it really?

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.840
[Nadine] "Have you ever fallen in love?"

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:57.920
[Mark] "I've fallen for you."

00:11:58.800 --> 00:11:59.920
[Nadine] "Oh, come on..."

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:02.200
[Narration] "You talked about love for some reason..."

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.160
[Mark] Who knows why...

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:04.120
A dot-du-dot...

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:05.620
[Nadine] "Ah, I'm a little tired..."

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:07.260
[Mark] Well then let's sleep!

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:09.980
Let's just sleepy-sleepy-sleep...

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:11.240
[Nadine] "Ah, sleeping early?"

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:12.640
"Well, sweet dreams."

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:13.500
[Mark] You too!

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:16.500
[Narration] "You took a nap, and felt something touch your cheek."

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:19.960
[Mark] Awoh! It's the blood from my ceiling...

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:23.180
Oh, it always flows and comforts me so much...

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:26.220
[Nadine] "So, um... tomorrow's our last day..."

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:28.200
[Mark] FINALLY! Ju-Just go!

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:28.820
I will miss you.

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:30.860
So much.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:31.660
BABY!

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:34.380
[Nadine] "Anyways, I have to prepare for tomorrow, night night!"

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:36.560
[Narration] "You had a well-deserved rest."

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.140
[Ominous voice] "You're doing better than last time!"

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:39.180
[Mark] Supposedly...

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:42.060
[Nadine] "Morning! We should enjoy this moment as much as we can!"

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:42.880
[Mark] Hah!

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:44.200
Let's PLAY!

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:45.640
YAY!

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.480
[Narration] "Nadine brings a Rubik's Cube."

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.260
[Nadine] "Hey, ever tried to solve one of these?"

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:50.640
[Mark] Not really.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:55.160
[Nadine] "I played this a lot when I was a kid, let me show you how a pro handles this!"

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:57.400
[Narration] "You played with Nadine for a long while."

00:12:57.780 --> 00:12:59.380
[Mark] Dot dot. Dot dot dot dot.

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:01.180
[Narration] "Nadine's nowhere to be found."

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:02.920
"Has she left already...?"

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:03.800
[Mark] (muttering) Oh, no...

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:05.220
Dot dot dot.

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:07.700
[Narration] "You felt a presence behind you."

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:08.620
[Mark] AH!

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:10.000
OH! OH GOD!

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.520
[Nadine] "Sorry, I had to leave a little early."

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:14.560
"I, uh... went to the agency and..."

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:19.840
"Asked if I could... have an extension on ... being your caretaker..."

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:22.680
[Mark] Oh... Senpai...

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:25.500
[Nadine] "I've grown fond of you... and... well..."

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:29.260
"I wanted to spend time with you... more..."

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:29.960
[Mark] Oh.

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:31.820
Geez.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:33.460
Well gosh.

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:36.080
Oh, Oh! OH GOD!

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:39.020
I LOVE YOU! I LOVE YOU SO MUCH!

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:41.260
I LOVE EVERYTHING ABOUT YOU!!

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:42.520
[Nadine] "M-Me too..."

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:43.260
[Mark] GREAT!

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.720
Oh, now I don't have to EAT you!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:52.120
If you would have rejected me, I would have just gobbled you up right on the spot to save myself from the embarrassment!

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:52.900
Oh!

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:56.400
Why do I have nails-- (chuckling)

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:57.840
Do I have nails in my head?

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:01.400
And why am I blushing with the back of my skull?

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.740
Is that just where I radiate heat?

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:04.760
[Narration] "You hugged Nadine."

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:05.340
[Nadine] "A-ah!"

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:09.100
"What should we do today? Hee hee."

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:13.060
[Mark] AYYY! I guess that's the end! What the fuck?

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:16.480
Alright then! We did good. Maybe? I dunno.

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:17.880
Maybe that was good.

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:23.720
I-I'm gonna -- I'm gonna try to understand, and I'm gonna look up a little bit of a walkthrough to see if there was something else I could have done there.

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:28.420
Okay, so apparently there's a middle-of-the-road ending and that was the best ending. I DID IT!

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:35.720
I'm the master of love! No matter what I do I just fall in love where ever I go, except the real world because that's not... applicable...

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:46.680
Anyways, so, yeah! There's a middle-of-the-road ending and then there's a good ending - which is what we got - and the bad ending is when you eat her....

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:51.600
But maybe there's more out there, I'll put a link for the game in the description below and maybe you can try to find another ending.

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:55.000
It's pretty fun! I like it a lot! It's charming in a way.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:57.140
And I believe this came from GameJam so,

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:59.180
Thank you everybody so much for watching,

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:00.980
let me know how I did down in the comments below.

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:06.900
And as always! I will see you- in the next video! BUH-BYE!

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:15.880
(outro music)

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:19.000
BUH-BYE! from the subtitle contributors :)

